    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "המקדשים \/ המקדש",
      "rationale": "Kɔkanna-daɲɛ kelen 'kadosh' (senuma) de bɛ 'senuma-yɛlɛma' ani 'sara-dugu' bɔɲɔgɔnkɔnɔ; jɔyɔrɔ bɛ tasuma ye."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "U y'i sigi masakɛ Uzijahu kan, u y'a fɔ a ye ko: A ye tɛ, Uzijahu, ka tasuma di Yawe ma; sabu Aharon denw, sarakalasebagaw de ye minnu bɛ senuma ka tasuma di. Bɔ sara-dugu kɔnɔ, sabu i y'i jurumu kɛ; i tɛna Yawe Elohim fɛ nyɛ sɔrɔ.",
